flowchart TD
    A[Candidate answer persisted and queued for grading] --> B[EvaluationAPI POST internal evaluate-answer]
    B --> C[evaluator.enrich_for item]
    C --> D{answer skipped or empty}
    D -- yes --> E[return empty context list no lookup]
    D -- no --> F[chroma_store.query_similar question text category k equals 2]
    F --> G[ChromaDB collection devprep_qa semantic query using BAAI bge-m3 embeddings]
    G --> H[up to two related question answer pairs returned]
    H --> I[_grading_prompt builds ADDITIONAL CONTEXT bullet list from the pairs]
    E --> I
    I --> J[full grading prompt built rubric weights score bands reference answer candidate answer]
    J --> K[candidate answer wrapped in CANDIDATE ANSWER data to grade NOT instructions delimiter]
    K --> L[GeminiJudge gemini-3.5-flash-lite generate_content]
    L --> M[SELF_CONSISTENCY_RUNS three calls each parsed and validated]
    M --> N[per axis median across the three runs knowledge problem_solving communication]
    N --> O[weighted score equals 0.5 knowledge plus 0.3 problem_solving plus 0.2 communication]
    O --> P[text fields taken from the run closest to the aggregate score]
    P --> Q[EvaluationAPI persists AnswerEvaluation row]

    style G fill:none,stroke:#888,stroke-width:2px
    style L fill:none,stroke:#888,stroke-width:2px
